# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# AppVelocity — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# Never commit .env to version control.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Figma (required for DesignToCodeAgent) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Generate at: https://www.figma.com/settings → Personal Access Tokens
FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=figd_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── LLM Proxy (Coforge QuasarMarket router) ───────────────────────────────────
# Both Claude and OpenAI models are routed through the same proxy endpoint.
# Use v2 for standard completions, v3 for TrustAI-enabled completions.
LLM_API_URL=https://quasarmarket.coforge.com/qag/llmrouter-api/v2/chat/completions

# Shared bearer token for the proxy (same key authenticates all models)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
OPENAI_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Model names (passed as-is to the proxy router)
# Claude — used by GeneratorAgent (code synthesis)
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4
# OpenAI — used by PlannerAgent and CriticAgent (structured JSON reasoning)
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o
OPENAI_FAST_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ── Web App ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Caching — Redis (optional, falls back to in-memory) ──────────────────────
REDIS_ENABLED=false
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# ── Rate Limiting ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
FIGMA_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=60
LLM_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=50
PARALLEL_REQUESTS=5

# ── Logging ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LOG_LEVEL=info
# Verbose debug output (use appvelocity:* for everything)
DEBUG=

# ── Development ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development

# ── Agent Settings ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Max LangGraph reflection iterations before giving up
MAX_ITERATIONS=3
# Cache Figma API responses to disk (speeds up re-runs on same file)
IR_CACHE_ENABLED=true

# ── Telemetry (opt-in, default off) ──────────────────────────────────────────
TELEMETRY_ENABLED=false
SENTRY_DSN=
